  "details": "There appears to be unintended jump behavior when rapidly pressing the jump button (approximately every 20ms) near the edge of objects or at the peaks of sloped surfaces.\n\nWhen jump input is spammed in these edge or slope positions, the avatar performs multiple consecutive jumps in rapid succession, resulting in an abnormally high jump that is not achievable through normal input.\n\nThis behavior becomes more pronounced at higher frame rates (e.g., 120 FPS or above), suggesting a frame-rate-dependent input issue where more jump inputs are registered than intended.\n\nThis issue has been confirmed on both PC and standalone Quest.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/SyWVHYnDCYY?feature=shared",
